{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13730","headline":"大茅岭东新居忆亡子从真 · 顾况","name":"大茅岭东新居忆亡子从真","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谷鸟犹呼儿，山人夕沾襟。\n怀哉隔生死，怅矣徒登临。\n东门忧不入，西河遇亦深。\n古来失中道，偶向经中寻。\n大象无停轮，倏忽成古今。\n其夭非不幸，链形由太阴。\n凡欲攀云阶，譬如火铸金。\n虚室留旧札，洞房掩闲琴。\n泉源登方诸，上有空青林。\n彷佛通寤寐，萧寥邈微音。\n软草被汀洲，鲜云略浮沈。\n赬景宣叠丽，绀波响飘淋。\n石窟含云巢，迢迢耿南岑。\n悲恨自兹断，情尘讵能侵。\n真静一时变，作起唯从心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}